        "pf_769699be_value": "<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/about-us\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">About Us</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Contact Us</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/terms-conditions\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Terms & Conditions</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Privacy Po<sup></sup><sup></sup>licy</a>",
        "pf_7089f029_value": "ThePhotoStick OMNI is a small but powerful device that&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">automatically finds, sorts, and safely backs up</span> your photos, videos and other files. It's perfect for anyone who wants to keep their memories safe and organized WITHOUT all the hassle, time, and money it would cost to do it yourself!",
        "pf_5052597b_value": "I had a grand total of about 60,000 images, with many duplicates. This little “stick” managed to eliminate the duplicates so that I now have about 24,000 originals preserved forever in a fire-proof vault, a cost-free and independent method of safekeeping.\n\n",
        "pf_21bf37c9_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Convenient &amp; Secure - </span>ThePhotoStick® OMNI keeps all your most important files right at your fingertips, so they're easily accessible when you need them – yet stored safely and away from hackers.\n",
        "pf_2737f1ad_value": "The Photo Stick works just the way it says it does; very easy to use. I checked it when done, and there were my pictures. There is so much room on the stick that I should be able to use it for years to backup documents and pictures.\n\n",
        "pf_79e57d81_value": "This thing is amazing! Plugged it into my iMac and it found all my pics and saved them. 85,000+ pics saved! Saved storage space on my computer and now I have all of these memories over the past decade saved in a safe place.\n\n",
        "pf_0f53ead6_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Easy To Use - </span>Simply plug in ThePhotoStick® OMNI and click 'GO'! It does everything automatically. No complicated setup, logins, or software to install!\n",
        "pf_dae0eb75_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">65% of people or their family members have lost their files as a result of accidental deletion, hardware failure, or software problem.\n\n</span>",
        "pf_d6cd8721_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Works On All Devices - </span>Works on all computers, phones and operating systems – including Windows, Apple, Android, Google, and more!\n",
        "pf_5b8368b7_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Finds ALL Your Photos &amp; Videos<br></span>Searches EVERY file &amp; folder to ensure no picture or video is ever missed.",
        "pf_91a484aa_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Finds ALL Your Photos &amp; Videos<br></span>Searches EVERY file &amp; folder to ensure no picture or video is ever missed.",
        "pf_c90e2ddc_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">Don’t risk losing all your memories – back them up in minutes with ThePhotostick® OMNI!\n</span>",
        "pf_52d4f5e3_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Keeps Your Files Safe\n<br></span>Never worry about your computer crashing or losing files in the cloud again.",
        "pf_78746dfe_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sorts Files For You</span><br>Automatically organizes your files neatly into folders so they’re easy to find.",
        "pf_f1e79ae8_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sorts Files For You<br></span>Automatically organizes your files neatly into folders so they’re easy to find.",
        "pf_0e7434f1_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Keeps Your Files Safe<br></span>Never worry about your computer crashing or losing files in the cloud again.",
